fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstobject.html#gst_object_call_async","fragment":"\n\tgst_object_call_async\n\n\n\tGst.Object.prototype.call_async\n\n\n\tGst.Object.call_async\n\nEquivalent to gst_element_call_async but this API allows func to be called\nwith GstObject. See also gst_element_call_async\nParameters:\na GstObject\nfunction to call asynchronously from another thread\ndata to pass to func\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nEquivalent to Gst.Element.prototype.call_async but this API allows func to be called\nwith Gst.Object. See also Gst.Element.prototype.call_async\nParameters:\na Gst.Object\nfunction to call asynchronously from another thread\ndata to pass to func\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nEquivalent to Gst.Element.call_async but this API allows func to be called\nwith Gst.Object. See also Gst.Element.call_async\nParameters:\na Gst.Object\nfunction to call asynchronously from another thread\ndata to pass to func\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});